      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS proudly present this excellent three bedroom end terrace property to the market within the ever sought after Liffey Downs, Lucan. The home boasts a prime location within walking distance of Ballyowen shopping centre, schools, sports and recreational facilities. Lucan village and Liffey Valley shopping centre are also within easy reach. Public transport is excellent to and from the city centre via Dublin Bus with a bus stop only 2 minutes' walk while the M50 gives access to the airport and beyond. \r\n\r\nBright, spacious and immaculately presented living accommodation of c. 92 Sqm can be found here and in brief consists of entrance hallway lounge, wc, living room and open plan refitted kitchen/dining room to the ground floor. Upstairs you will find three well proportioned bedrooms with master benefitting from ensuite and also the family bathroom. Externally you will find a well manicured SOUTH/WEST facing rear garden with patio area, brick built storage shed and side access to the front when there is designated parking. \r\n\r\nNo. 8 comes to the market in pristine condition having been much improved and maintained by its current owners, further benefits here include gas central heating, double glazed windows and is situated in a quiet cul de sac location. Due to location and condition we see this property be extremely popular so please call Ray Cooke Auctioneers for further information or to arrange viewing\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\nBER C\r\nc. 92 Sqm\r\n3 bed, 3 bath\r\nCul de sac location\r\nSOUTH/WEST facing rear garden\r\nSought after location\r\nTurn key condition\r\nParking to front\r\nClose to amenities\r\nCall today to arrange a viewing!\r\n\r\nDirections\r\nK78 FY68"
      },
      {
